# Pi-hole Blocklist — TikTok (domains)
# Generated: 2026-03-18
# Purpose: Block TikTok web/app access and TikTok-hosted media/CDN endpoints.
# Notes:
# - Pi-hole blocklists are domain-based.
# - This blocks TikTok-owned domains + common TikTok CDNs used for video, images, API.
# - It cannot fully prevent "previews" that are re-hosted/cached by the search engine itself.

# Core site
tiktok.com
www.tiktok.com
m.tiktok.com

# Core APIs / service subdomains (commonly seen)
api.tiktok.com
api16.tiktok.com
api19.tiktok.com
api21.tiktok.com
api22.tiktok.com

# Shortlinks / redirects
vm.tiktok.com
vt.tiktok.com

# TikTok CDN / media hosting
tiktokcdn.com
www.tiktokcdn.com
p16.tiktokcdn.com
p19.tiktokcdn.com
p21.tiktokcdn.com
p26.tiktokcdn.com
p77.tiktokcdn.com

# Video hosting (commonly used)
tiktokv.com
www.tiktokv.com
v16.tiktokv.com
v19.tiktokv.com
v21.tiktokv.com
v22.tiktokv.com
v26.tiktokv.com

# Legacy / Musical.ly
musical.ly
www.musical.ly

# TikTok / ByteDance auxiliary domains often involved in auth/infra
bytedance.com
www.bytedance.com
byteoversea.com
www.byteoversea.com

# Commonly associated ad/analytics endpoints under TikTok/ByteDance umbrellas (optional, stricter)
# (Uncomment if you want to be aggressive; may have collateral impact on other ByteDance properties.)
# tiktokads.com
# www.tiktokads.com
# analytics.tiktok.com

# --- Companion Pi-hole REGEX suggestions (copy into Pi-hole regex list) ---
# ^(^|\.)tiktok\.com$
# ^(^|\.)tiktokcdn\.com$
# ^(^|\.)tiktokv\.com$
# ^(^|\.)musical\.ly$
# ^(^|\.)vm\.tiktok\.com$
# ^(^|\.)vt\.tiktok\.com$
